IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sgh-part2-administration`

-- Tests for sgh-part2-administration.l4 (s 8). Every expected value is written from the text of the section, beside the assertion, before the run.

§ `s 8(2): acts of a Deputy or Assistant Registrar`
-- (test alias a82 = `s 8(2) the act is as valid and effectual as if it had been done or signed by the Registrar`)
-- arguments: the act is one the Act appoints, authorises or requires the Registrar to do or sign; done or signed by a Deputy or Assistant Registrar; within the Registrar's direction and the prescribed restrictions
#ASSERT `s 8(2) the act is as valid and effectual as if it had been done or signed by the Registrar` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- all three: "may be done or signed by any such Deputy or Assistant Registrar and is as valid and effectual as if done or signed by the Registrar"
#ASSERT `s 8(2) the act is as valid and effectual as if it had been done or signed by the Registrar` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- not an act the Act gives the Registrar: the text does not say
#ASSERT `s 8(2) the act is as valid and effectual as if it had been done or signed by the Registrar` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- done by someone other than a Deputy or Assistant Registrar: the text does not say
#ASSERT `s 8(2) the act is as valid and effectual as if it had been done or signed by the Registrar` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- outside the direction and control or the prescribed restrictions: "Subject to ..." limits the grant, the text does not say the act is invalid
#ASSERT `s 8(2) the act is as valid and effectual as if it had been done or signed by the Registrar` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- none

§ `s 8(3): the person dealing with a Deputy or Assistant Registrar`
-- (test alias a83a = `s 8(3) the person dealing with a Deputy or Assistant Registrar needs to be concerned to see or inquire about prescribed restrictions or limitations`)
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the person dealing with a Deputy or Assistant Registrar needs to be concerned to see or inquire about prescribed restrictions or limitations` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "No person dealing with any Deputy or Assistant Registrar needs to be concerned to see or inquire"
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the person dealing with a Deputy or Assistant Registrar needs to be concerned to see or inquire about prescribed restrictions or limitations` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- a person not dealing with a Deputy or Assistant Registrar: the text does not say
-- (test alias a83b = `s 8(3) the act or omission is as valid and effectual, so far as it affects the person, as if it had been done or omitted by the Registrar`)
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the act or omission is as valid and effectual, so far as it affects the person, as if it had been done or omitted by the Registrar` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "every act or omission of a Deputy or Assistant Registrar so far as it affects any such person is as valid and effectual"
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the act or omission is as valid and effectual, so far as it affects the person, as if it had been done or omitted by the Registrar` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- an act that does not affect the person
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the act or omission is as valid and effectual, so far as it affects the person, as if it had been done or omitted by the Registrar` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- an act of someone who is not a Deputy or Assistant Registrar
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the act or omission is as valid and effectual, so far as it affects the person, as if it had been done or omitted by the Registrar` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- neither

§ `s 8(4): judicial notice`
-- (test alias a84 = `s 8(4) the tribunal is to take judicial notice of the seal or signature`)
#ASSERT `s 8(4) the tribunal is to take judicial notice of the seal or signature` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "All courts, judges and persons acting judicially are to take judicial notice of the seal and signature of the Registrar and of any Deputy or Assistant Registrar"
#ASSERT `s 8(4) the tribunal is to take judicial notice of the seal or signature` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- not a court, judge or person acting judicially: the text does not say
#ASSERT `s 8(4) the tribunal is to take judicial notice of the seal or signature` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- some other seal or signature: the text does not say
#ASSERT `s 8(4) the tribunal is to take judicial notice of the seal or signature` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- neither
